 srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>这里真漂亮，但是看起来并不像吃饭的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>开阔的礼堂中摆放着桌椅与餐桌，喷香的食物盛在银碟子里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>不过没关系，有吃的东西的地方就是吃饭的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>这个深色的带有气泡的水是什么？我要尝一口……咳咳咳！哇啊！<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>呸，呸呸——我讨厌这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无论如何，洁西卡填饱了肚子。她不会在午夜因为饥饿而苏醒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">提示音：</div><div>CO-092146，学员洁西卡。<br />休息时间即将结束，进入5分30秒倒计时，请尽快返回学员宿舍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>啊，是时候回去了，我记得宿舍的方向是在……</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>破旧的食堂空荡荡，空气里满是食物的香味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>嗯？今天的食物，换了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>紫色的汤……嗯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>真是令人惊讶的美味！我从没有尝过又酸又甜又苦又辣这样好喝的东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>奇怪……这是谁做的汤呢？</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>这个香味……今天又是好喝的汤！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>多来点多来点……嗯？</div></div></div></div></div><div