lapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弯下身子，仔细观察，汤锅旁留有几个脚印与一小撮深褐色的绒毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>这是……毛发？</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"6\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-alig