c=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaoshitang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>嗯……什么东西会在锅边落下毛发呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>啊，这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">厨师帽魔精：</div><div>唧唧咕～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的魔精正拿着大大的铁铲，胡乱地搅动着锅里的汤。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>原来是卡邦克鲁！<br /></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"7\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic